  steps:
  - type: 0
    text: Ah, there you are, Kenji! Welcome to the harbour town of [Town Name].
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
    delayTime: 0
    teleportPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    teleportSceneName: 
    onStepTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - type: 0
    text: The sea here is generous, the sunsets are golden, and the fish... well,
      they can be a little shy.
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
    delayTime: 0
    teleportPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    teleportSceneName: 
    onStepTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - type: 0
    text: Our family has run a sushi restaurant on this shore for three generations.
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
    delayTime: 0
    teleportPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    teleportSceneName: 
    onStepTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - type: 1
    text: 
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
    delayTime: 0
    teleportPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    teleportSceneName: 
    onStepTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - type: 0
    text: But times are tough, and the doors may close for good unless we turn things
      around.
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
    delayTime: 0
    teleportPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    teleportSceneName: 
    onStepTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - type: 0
    text: "By day, you\u2019ll go fishing. Grab some bait from the shop, cast your
      line, and see what bites."
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
    delayTime: 0
    teleportPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    teleportSceneName: 
    onStepTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - type: 1
    text: 
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
    delayTime: 0
    teleportPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    teleportSceneName: 
    onStepTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - type: 0
    text: "By night, you\u2019ll bring your catch to the restaurant and turn it into
      sushi."
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
    delayTime: 0
    teleportPosition: {x: 0, y: 0}
    teleportSceneName: 
    onStepTrigger:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - type: 0
    text: "Fish by day, serve by night. Do it well, and Kenji\u2019s Sushi will live
      on!"
    textFadeTime: 0
    audioToPlay: {fileID: 0}
    graphicToShow: {fileID: 0}
    graphicFadeTime: 0
    clearTextBeforeGraphic: 0
